魚卷，麵條偏硬的話比較好吃～ 湯底不會很鹹，濃度跟調味對我來說剛剛好。 （喜歡重口味的應該會喜歡鹹一點）那一塊豚肉讚爆！🥹 肥瘦剛剛好，很入味，口感軟硬適中，不會乾柴。可惜有點小一塊，但以200左右台幣的價錢和份量來說，真係超級划算～～ 小鳥胃或者正在減食量的朋友們，吃完一碗也不會很撐，剛剛好。胃口比較好的朋友也可以免費要求加麵喔～\n\n可是，個人不推薦鮭魚卷，米飯的口感有點太硬，像是在室溫下放了很久的感覺。調味吃起來很普通，不至於要必吃。但大家也可以吃吃看他們家的小吃，看起來好像很好吃～\n\n整體來說，這間拉麵店很棒啦～ 想不到吃什麼可以來吃吃看！",null,[0,75]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/2314112151663349924/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhSalJqbHZUMjV3UkZaSVJuaGFNSEJVWVROa05HRkdTWGRXUkdNelZHMUtibUl5WXhBQhAB",[null,null,null,"/local/business/2314112151663349924/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhSalJqbHZUMjV3UkZaSVJuaGFNSEJVWVROa05HRkdTWGRXUkdNelZHMUtibUl5WXhBQhAB"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/2314112151663349924/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhSalJqbHZUMjV3UkZaSVJuaGFNSEJVWVROa05HRkdTWGRXUkdNelZHMUtibUl5WXhBQhAB",[null,null,null,"/local/business/2314112151663349924/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhSalJqbHZUMjV3UkZaSVJuaGFNSEJVWVROa05HRkdTWGRXUkdNelZHMUtibUl5WXhBQhAB"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/2314112151663349924/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhSalJqbHZUMjV3UkZaSVJuaGFNSEJVWVROa05HRkdTWGRXUkdNelZHMUtibUl5WXhBQhAB",[null,null,null,"/local/business/2314112151663349924/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhSalJqbHZUMjV3UkZaSVJuaGFNSEJVWVROa05HRkdTWGRXUkdNelZHMUtibUl5WXhBQhAB"]],[null,null,null,["https://www.google.com/maps/@/data\u003d!4m7!23m6!1m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHRjRjlvT25wRFZIRnhaMHBUYTNkNGFGSXdWRGMzVG1KbmIyYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x496d03837415df26!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChttcF9oOnpDVHFxZ0pTa3d4aFIwVDc3TmJnb2c%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHRjRjlvT25wRFZIRnhaMHBUYTNkNGFGSXdWRGMzVG1KbmIyYxAB\u0026t\u003d3\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHRjRjlvT25wRFZIRnhaMHBUYTNkNGFGSXdWRGMzVG1KbmIyYxI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHRjRjlvT25wRFZIRnhaMHBUYTNkNGF